'''FC Jeunesse Canach''' ({{langx|en|FC Youth Canach}}) is a [[Association football|football]] club in [[Canach, Luxembourg|Canach]], Luxembourg. It was founded in 1930. They play in the [[Luxembourg Division of Honour|Division of Honour]], the second tier of Luxembourgish football."}}
